{"full_name":"lss233/kirara-ai","owner":"lss233","name":"kirara-ai","url":"https://github.com/lss233/kirara-ai","description":"🤖 可 DIY 的 多模态 AI 聊天机器人 | 🚀 快速接入 微信、 QQ、Telegram、等聊天平台 | 🦈支持DeepSeek、Grok、Claude、Ollama、Gemini、OpenAI | 工作流系统、网页搜索、AI画图、人设调教、虚拟女仆、语音对话 | ","homepage":"https://kirara-docs.app.lss233.com/","topics":["chatgpt","openai","qq","qqbot","bot","new-bing","sydney","bard","discord","ernie","poe","chatglm-6b","go-cqhttp","mirai","telegram"],"tag_pages":["bot","chatgpt","openai"],"language":"Python","license":"AGPL-3.0","avatar":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8984680?u=e4d7e61d39e149291469ba6d5f09532595ad84e3&v=4","created_at":"2022-12-05T13:14:58Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-22T09:34:31Z","metrics":{"stars":19291,"forks":1835,"watchers":99,"issues":1111,"prs":322,"releases":75,"issues_open":2,"issues_closed":1109,"prs_open":0,"prs_closed":106,"prs_merged":216,"discussions":37},"growth":{"day":{"stars":6,"forks":-1,"base_day":"2026-11-13"}},"history":{"dates":["2026-11-10","2026-11-11","2026-11-12","2026-11-13","2026-11-14"],"stars":[19273,19280,19286,19285,19291],"forks":[1836,1835,1836,1836,1835],"watchers":[null,99,99,99,99],"issues_open":[null,2,2,2,2],"prs_open":[null,0,0,0,0]},"boards":{},"same_owner":[{"full_name":"lss233/chatgpt-mirai-qq-bot","name":"chatgpt-mirai-qq-bot","boards":{}}],"issues":[{"number":1524,"title":"对master 分支的类型检查发现了 22 个问题 (36249e4)","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-22T08:35:51Z"},{"number":85,"title":"搭建常见问题解答 | FAQ","comments":0,"created_at":"2023-02-09T06:36:10Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":1519,"title":"现在QQ已经不用token鉴权了","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-06-11T08:45:04Z"},{"number":1516,"title":"Open source Claude Code investment skills — options flow scanner + price alerts","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-05-13T13:36:41Z"},{"number":1491,"title":"启动GPT时 browserless url报错502","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2025-06-27T05:38:03Z"},{"number":1459,"title":"预设系统现在不可用了吗？","comments":1,"category":"General","created_at":"2025-04-14T16:45:41Z"},{"number":1435,"title":"配置qq机器人遇到问题","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2025-03-22T15:06:43Z"},{"number":1399,"title":"[早期预览版] WebUI 能力、插件系统、工作流设计","comments":0,"category":"Announcements","created_at":"2025-02-16T13:57:16Z"},{"number":1396,"title":"[早期预览版] WebUI 能力、插件系统、工作流设计","comments":2,"category":"Announcements","created_at":"2025-02-09T21:01:53Z"},{"number":1368,"title":"如何关闭流式传输","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2024-08-29T09:17:19Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"v3.2.1 - 安全更新：修复 Web 面板认证绕过漏洞","tag":"v3.2.1","published_at":"2026-10-22T09:34:32Z","body":"## 🔒 安全更新（强烈建议所有用户立即升级）\n\n本版本修复了一个 Web 管理面板的严重安全漏洞。\n\n**如果你将实例暴露在公网上，请务必立即升级，不要延迟。**\n\n**升级须知**：\n- 升级后所有已登录会话将失效，需要重新登录（这是预期行为）\n- 升级不会影响 `data` 目录下的任何数据\n- 如果你的实例曾暴露在公网，建议同时检查并轮换所有配置中的 API 密钥\n\n## 如何部署？\n请移步至[这里](https://kirara-docs.app.lss233.com/guide/getting-started.html)。\n\n## 如何升级？\n\n可以从 WebUI 进行升级。\n\n> TIP: 如果遇到 WebUI 反复提示升级的情况，通常是因为浏览器缓存了旧版导致的，请按 Ctrl + Shift + R 或者 Shift + F5 强制刷新缓存。\n\n也可以按照下面的方式进行手动升级：\n\nDocker 用户：\n```bash\ndocker compose pull && docker compose up -d\n```\nWindows 用户：\n下载下方快速启动包并解压，将旧版的 `data` 文件夹覆盖至新版即可。\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}